Z||000000||Ozzy||09-25-2000||01:47 AM||||Hi folks...<P>Just wanted to see who's in the bay area and near by from the forum. I already posted this in DXR-DAD's thread...I will be moving to somewhere south of San Jose in the next month or so and would like to be able to meet up with some other Fiero folks sometime.<P>I know Tgowens is from there, along with George and DXR-DAD. mshill and Terryk are not too far away near Sac. (TerryK, if you read this I sure would like to meet up with you sometime; I owe you one! I will also be around Sac. quite a bit.) Isn't someone over in Modesto??<P>Anyway, not to ramble on...lookin' forward to meeting you folks in the future.<P>Ozzy||||reg||2
