Z||000012||tgowens||09-26-2000||12:06 PM||||Hey Ozzy!! good to see you back on here (you kinda come and go just like I do at times!!) -- I "live" in Paso Robles (which is 27 miles north of San Luis Obispo on 101) but work here in Richmond, CA through the week (Monday thru Saturday) at the Fiero Shop -- you really need to stop in here when you get to CA!! -- call us here anytime at 1-510-23-FIERO (1-510-233-4376) -- call me (or george) and we will give you directions to the shop -- and, let me be among the first to welcome you to CA!!<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/Terry_sig.gif">                    <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A><BR>Gold '87 GT<BR>Blue '87 GT||||reg||1
Z||000013||Ozzy||09-26-2000||12:48 PM||||Big-O & Kevin...I'll be sure to catch up eventually...It's good to be going back to a place fulla Fiero's. I was near SCCA Fiero for awhile in Utah. We talked on the phone once but time never permitted us to get together. I really wanted to check out his hybrid too! <P>Tgowens...man thats a hike!!? Paso Robles to Richmond?? Surely you dont do that everyday. Actually, Paso Robles is one place I'm gonna look to live. We are looking for peace and quiet as in acreage (5-20) and out of the way. We have horses and I like to ride my ol' TT500 on the weekends for fun too.<P>I took a sabatical for a little while. I wa skinda loosing interest and had to sell my Coupe for pennies compared to what I had into it just to pay bills. But I'm hangin' onto ol' Blue for sure. I almost sold it but let the '88 Coupe go at the last minute.<P>I have plans for the '87 GT as soon as I get caught up on some bills. Gotta find a house with a decent garage or shop too. When I tear the GT to pieces, it won't be going back together for awhile.<P>I appreciate the response from all you guys in California and hope to at least hook up with some of you very soon.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>There are 3 types of people in this world;<P><I>Those who make things happen,<BR>Those who watch things happen,<BR>And those who wonder <B>What Da hell Happened?!</B></I> <P>  :D  Ozzy  :D<BR>'87 GT (Ol' Blue)||||reg||6
